// ************** MOS-MUSIC OpenHymnal ABC → JPW-ABC 1.0 **************\n// source = sources/openhymnal/OpenHymnal2014.06.abc\n// match = exact title match from content/production/tune-matching.json\n\n.Title\nTitle = 磐石之上（The Solid Rock）\nKeyAndMeters = {1=C,4/4}\nWordsByAndMusicBy = Words: Edward Mote, circa 1834.\nMusic: 'Melita' John Bacchus Dykes, 1861.  Setting: "Hymns Ancient and Modern", 1869.\ncopyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2011 Revision.\nExpression = {♩=100}\n\n.Voice\n1 | 3. 3_ 5 5 | 6 6 5 5 | 1' 2' 7 5 | 5 #4 5 2 | 4. 4_ 3 3 | 5. 5_ #4 7 | 5 #4 3 6 | 5 #4 3 3 | 3. 3_ 4 4 | #4. 4_ 5 5 | 5 6 5 3 | 2. 1_ 1 |\n\n.Words\nW1@1,1:\n{My} {hope} {is} {built} {on} {no} {thing} {less} {Than} {Je} {sus'} {blood} {and} {right} {eous} {ness.} I {dare} {not} {trust} {the} {sweet} {est} {frame,} {But} {whol} {ly} {trust} {in} {Je} {sus'} {Name.} {On} {Christ} {the} {so} {lid} {Rock} I {stand,} {All} o {ther} {ground} {is} {sink} {ing} {sand.}\n